WEBVTT

00:00:03.200 --> 00:00:05.892
In Preview, the agent is in control.

00:00:05.892 --> 00:00:09.802
A record is offered to an agent who is signed in to the

00:00:09.802 --> 00:00:11.917
campaign, with a countdown.

00:00:11.917 --> 00:00:16.660
The agent reads the record, then clicks Dial, or Skip to pass it on.

00:00:17.410 --> 00:00:21.121
The agent is held by the offer, before any call exists.

00:00:21.121 --> 00:00:26.718
When the agent clicks Dial, the server runs the compliance checks and places the call.

00:00:26.718 --> 00:00:29.820
The agent is on the call from the first ring.

00:00:31.397 --> 00:00:36.859
Open Interaction Center, Management, Dialer Profiles, and click Add Dialer Profile.

00:00:36.859 --> 00:00:38.823
Preview is the first Mode.

00:00:38.823 --> 00:00:40.603
Notice what is missing.

00:00:40.603 --> 00:00:45.451
There is no Calls per agent, no ring time, no answering machine screening

00:00:45.451 --> 00:00:47.537
and no Abandoned calls card.

00:00:47.537 --> 00:00:52.017
The agent places the call and listens to it, so none of them apply.

00:00:53.617 --> 00:00:57.320
What can go wrong is slow work, not abandoned calls.

00:00:57.320 --> 00:01:02.555
If nobody responds, the offer runs out and the record goes to another agent.

00:01:02.555 --> 00:01:07.471
If the call ends before it connects, the dialer records the outcome and

00:01:07.471 --> 00:01:09.577
the agent returns to Ready.

